# Prettier does not read .gitignore, so anything git-ignored that Prettier would
# otherwise walk has to be repeated here. oxlint needs none of this — it honours
# .gitignore already.

# Markdown is deliberately not formatted. Ultracite's Prettier config sets
# `proseWrap: "never"`, which would collapse every hand-wrapped paragraph in this
# repo's ADRs, plans and QA docs into one line each. Prose tooling is a separate
# argument with a separate rule set; see CONTRIBUTING.md.
**/*.md

# The local CLI playground — generated output, scaffolded fresh by `pnpm play:init`.
.dev/

# Generated by pnpm, not hand-edited, and reformatting it fights the lockfile.
pnpm-lock.yaml

# Build output and dependencies.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.astro
**/.wrangler
